Installed-Size: __INSTALLED_SIZE__
Maintainer: Mahmoud Kamal (KamalTD) <m.kamalvfx@gmail.com>
Homepage: https://vibrante-node.com
Description: VFX pipeline visual node editor
 Vibrante-Node is a graphical node-based pipeline editor for VFX studios
 and artists.  Connect nodes to build automation workflows for Houdini,
 Maya, Blender, and other DCC applications without writing pipeline code.
 .
 Features:
  * 160+ built-in nodes for file I/O, math, strings, and DCC control
  * Live Houdini bridge via TCP (JSON-RPC)
  * Prism Pipeline integration
  * Python node builder and scripting console
  * Subgraph/group nodes, autosave, canvas search, and mini-map
